254
00:16:23,700 --> 00:16:26,112
But it's gonna take some kind of miracle.

255
00:16:26,640 --> 00:16:29,377
I know there's something in
my deck that can help me.

256
00:16:29,460 --> 00:16:30,460
But what is it?

257
00:16:31,580 --> 00:16:33,340
Come on, heart of the cards.

258
00:16:33,700 --> 00:16:34,780
Show me some love.

259
00:16:45,340 --> 00:16:47,060
What's up with my deck?

260
00:16:53,780 --> 00:16:55,500
The Eye of Timaeus!

261
00:16:55,720 --> 00:16:56,560
It's glowing!

262
00:17:06,540 --> 00:17:08,080
My dual disc!

263
00:17:09,120 --> 00:17:10,620
It's that dragon!

264
00:17:10,980 --> 00:17:12,580
It's the Fang of Critias!

265
00:17:26,560 --> 00:17:27,780
Hey, where are we?

266
00:17:28,020 --> 00:17:30,785
And, uh, wasn't I just
in the middle of a duel?

267
00:17:31,000 --> 00:17:32,824
I've been to this place before.

268
00:17:33,160 --> 00:17:35,042
It's the Dominion of the Beasts.

269
00:17:37,180 --> 00:17:38,010
Whoa!

270
00:17:38,180 --> 00:17:40,180
That's one big ice sculpture!

271
00:17:40,500 --> 00:17:44,120
It's a dragon, frozen
in time. Huh? Say what?

272
00:17:44,340 --> 00:17:46,580
And I have a feeling it's chosen you.

273
00:17:46,860 --> 00:17:50,980
If my theory's correct, then you
must remove that sword. Then what?

274
00:17:51,260 --> 00:17:53,378
Then the ancient dragon will awaken.

275
00:17:53,700 --> 00:17:54,760
Here goes nothing.

276
00:18:00,500 --> 00:18:01,330
Whoa!

277
00:18:01,500 --> 00:18:02,580
You are the one.

278
00:18:04,000 --> 00:18:04,860
That's weird.

279
00:18:05,120 --> 00:18:09,414
I could have sworn that I heard someone
talking to me through that sword.

280
00:18:10,240 --> 00:18:11,220
Yes, Joey.

281
00:18:11,500 --> 00:18:13,480
You must release Hermos.

282
00:18:22,740 --> 00:18:26,600
Looks like it worked Now I
got one more question, Yug

283
00:18:27,860 --> 00:18:30,080
Is this thing friendly?

284
00:18:38,180 --> 00:18:39,760
Was that a dream?

285
00:18:41,500 --> 00:18:42,330
him?

286
00:18:42,413 --> 00:18:44,698
Now Joey's got one of those
dragons in his deck, too.

287
00:18:44,880 --> 00:18:46,233
That could be just what

288
00:18:48,740 --> 00:18:49,957
he needs to end this.

289
00:18:50,040 --> 00:18:51,297
What was that?

290
00:18:51,380 --> 00:18:53,140
Are you okay, Seto?

291
00:18:53,540 --> 00:18:55,720
Did you notice anything strange,

292
00:18:57,600 --> 00:18:58,430
Mokuba?

293
00:18:58,513 --> 00:19:00,900
Besides the way you're acting? I'm fine.

294
00:19:01,240 --> 00:19:02,070
Forget I asked.

295
00:19:02,153 --> 00:19:03,940
My Urikalko Stone.

296
00:19:04,580 --> 00:19:06,500
It's reacting to something.

297
00:19:07,100 --> 00:19:09,540
The Pharaoh must be behind this!

298
00:19:10,820 --> 00:19:12,291
Wheeler's acting strange.

299
00:19:13,500 --> 00:19:14,820
Make your move!

300
00:19:15,020 --> 00:19:16,255
I have a duel to win!

301
00:19:16,440 --> 00:19:17,480
Well, this is it.

302
00:19:17,700 --> 00:19:20,994
If I don't draw something
good now, I'm as good as gone.

303
00:19:26,660 --> 00:19:27,660
No way!

304
00:19:28,020 --> 00:19:29,817
It's that dragon, Hermos!

305
00:19:29,900 --> 00:19:32,180
Did he draw something good or not?

306
00:19:32,440 --> 00:19:34,260
Because this is his last shot.

307
00:19:36,120 --> 00:19:36,950
Awesome!

308
00:19:37,180 --> 00:19:39,957
Joey must have just drawn
the dragon he released.

309
00:19:40,040 --> 00:19:40,870
That's right.

310
00:19:41,120 --> 00:19:42,500
Its power is now his.

311
00:19:45,660 --> 00:19:47,400
Hermos, you're on.

312
00:19:47,940 --> 00:19:51,600
You're about to meet
my new friend, Hermos!
